/* Brainstorming section */

-- Filter the table according to the month (January) and the year (2023).

-- Sum the total number of projects completed and sum the total revenue generated.

-- Calculate the average revenue generated per project by dividing the total revenue
-- generated by the total number of projects completed.

-- Display the query results.

